@startuml seq-05-retry-lost-reply
title Sequence 5 – Failure: reply lost, retry with the same requestId (idempotency)

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Student
participant "Student\nConsumer" as C
participant "Transaction\nService" as TS
participant "Persistence\nService" as P

Student -> C : reserve 2 spots on date D
activate C
C -> C : requestId = "r-123"
C -> TS : reserve(token, "r-123", D, 2)
activate TS
TS -> P : findTransactionByRequestId("r-123")
P --> TS : not found
TS -> P : applyReservationChange(...)
P --> TS : COMMITTED
TS -x C : reply lost (network failure)
deactivate TS

C -> C : timeout (1.5 s) → outcome unknown

C -> TS : reserve(token, "r-123", D, 2)  [retry, same requestId]
activate TS
TS -> P : findTransactionByRequestId("r-123")
P --> TS : existing transaction (COMMITTED)
TS --> C : same Reservation + Transaction\n(no new effect)
deactivate TS
C --> Student : show reservation (2 spots, charged once)
deactivate C

note over C, P
  At-least-once delivery + idempotent processing
  = exactly-once effect (RNF-04).
end note

@enduml
